571dbf23c2b9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In this chapter, the algorithm for computing the right-nested basis is used \
to evaluate the symmetric compact basis.\nAn important note is that the \
derivations in this notebook follow a different notation for the parameters \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["a", "i"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "11cf1a47-9a96-4415-ba30-233612dc1a9c"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["b", "i"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "780fc584-848a-4343-b3ce-f9efe40f185a"],
 ", than those of the Section 2.2 in the paper: \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Efficient Trotter-Suzuki Schemes for Long-Time Quantum \
Dynamics\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].\nThe parameters in this notebook are \
multiplied by 1/2, which changes how the coefficient basis is derived."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9774874936738772`*^9, 3.977487504531962*^9}, {
